  more in Sha'ban than in any month besides Ramadan. Water the crops: raise
  fasting\, night vigilance and stamina now so you enter Ramadan at full ve
 locity\, never from a cold start. Mid-Sha'ban night (14→15) is observed 
 by many.\n• Executive anchor: Pre-warm the engine. No cold starts.\n\nHi
 jri dates follow the Saudi High Judiciary Council calendar (Aladhan HJCoSA
